.Dd February 14, 2026
.Dt VOP_READLINK 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm VOP_READLINK
.Nd read target of a symbolic link
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In sys/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn VOP_READLINK "struct vnode *vp" "struct uio *uio" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn VOP_READLINK
entry point reads the target path of a symbolic link.
.Pp
The arguments are:
.Bl -tag -width cred
.It Fa vp
The vnode of the symbolic link.
.It Fa uio
The location of the data to be read.
.It Fa cred
The user credentials to use for authorization.
.El
.Sh LOCKS
The vnode
.Fa vp
should be locked on entry and remains locked on return.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Zero is returned on success, otherwise an error code is returned.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width EOPNOTSUPP
.It Bq Er EOPNOTSUPP
The file system does not support symbolic links.
.It Bq Er EINVAL
The argument
.Fa vp
is not a symbolic link.
.It Bq Er EIO
An I/O error occurred while reading the link.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr VOP_SYMLINK 9
